        "query/main.py": "from .render import render\ndef transform(data):\n    return render(data)\n",
        "query/render.py": "import json\nfrom .selection import select\ndef render(data):\n    return json.dumps(select(data))\n",
        "query/selection.py": "def select(data):\n    return []\n"
      },
      "entry": "query/main.py",
      "goal": "修复 query 包处理对象 {items:[{active:boolean,name:string}]}。selection.py 使用固定 jmespath.search(\"items[?active == `true`].name\", data)，结果保持原顺序，items 缺失或为 null 则 []。render.py 使用 json.dumps 默认参数返回字符串；main.py 为 transform 入口。支持中文和空数组，不修改输入。",
      "public": [
        {
          "input": {
            "items": []
          },
          "expected": "[]"
        },
        {
          "input": {
            "items": [
              {
                "active": true,
                "name": "A"
              },
              {
                "active": false,
                "name": "B"
              }
            ]
          },
          "expected": "[\"A\"]"
        }
      ],
      "private": [
        {
          "input": {},
          "expected": "[]"
        },
        {
          "input": {
            "items": null
          },
          "expected": "[]"
        },
        {
          "input": {
            "items": [
              {
                "active": true,
                "name": "上海"
              },
              {
                "name": "absent"
              },
              {
                "active": true,
                "name": "C"
              }
            ]
          },
          "expected": "[\"\\u4e0a\\u6d77\", \"C\"]"
        },
        {
          "input": {
            "items": [
              {
                "active": 1,
                "name": "one"
              },
              {
                "active": true,
                "name": "yes"
              }
            ]
          },
          "expected": "[\"yes\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "package-money-refactor",
      "goal": "重构为 finance 包（__init__.py 保持空），保留四个模块职责，使用包内导入。修复四个模块，report.py 是入口 transform(data)。输入为记录数组，每项 cents 为整数分，category 为字符串或 null/缺省，void=true 的项忽略。类别为 (category 或空串).strip().casefold()，空类别写未分类。按类别累加整数分，再按类别 Unicode 字符顺序排序。输出 TSV 字符串：首行 category 和 amount；金额精确两位小数，负号只在负数时出现，禁止浮点计算，零为0.00。用 csv.writer 的制表分隔、最小引号和 LF 换行，每行含最后一行都有换行；空输入只有表头。不修改输入。四模块分别承担入口、类别归一、聚合、格式化，不引入第三方依赖。",
      "entry": "finance/report.py",
      "files": {
        "finance/__init__.py": "",
        "finance/report.py": "from .totals import collect\nfrom .formatting import render\ndef transform(data)\n    return render(collect(data))\n",
